\paragraph{Model, date and investigated scope.}
OpenAI GPT-6 Astra (configured model \texttt{gpt-6-astra}), ultra reasoning; generated 11 October 2026. Checks energy conservation, failure of momentum conservation, periodic Gaussian invariance and quartic generation by the exact asymmetric noise.

\paragraph{Sources and literature check.}
